  "whatThisAppTeaches": "What this app teaches",
  "aboutBody": "Rāsikh is for reading and memorising the Qurʼān: the true 15-line muṣḥaf in Madani and Indo-Pak scripts, a verse reader with word-by-word audio, marking and reviewing your recitation, memorising page by page, and fluency practice.\n\nIt is a study companion, not a substitute for a teacher: recitation and the Qirā’āt are transmitted person to person, and we encourage every learner to find a qualified teacher with ijāzah.",
  "creditsGratitude": "Credits & gratitude",
  "creditMarkazBody": "The word-by-word recitation that powers tap-to-hear across the entire Qur’an Reader is the work of Markaz Tafsir, served via QuranCDN. May Allah reward them — this app would not be what it is without their recordings.",
  "creditTunaijiBody": "Verse-by-verse recitation by Shaykh Khalifah Al-Tunaiji, served by EveryAyah.com.",
  "creditTextTitle": "Qur’an text — Tanzil & QUL",
  "creditTextBody": "Madani (Uthmani) text from the Tanzil project and the IndoPak text, bundled offline in QUL-compatible structures (qul.tarteel.ai). Tajwīd color spans are generated against this exact text.",
