  "drills": "Drills",
  "creditWaqarTitle": "Waqar Ahmed — Quran Revision Companion",
  "creditWaqarBody": "The 15-line Madani and Indo-Pak muṣḥaf — its Uthmani/Indo-Pak text, page and line layout data, and the DigitalKhatt, SurahNames, and Bismillah fonts — is adapted from Waqar Ahmed’s open-source Quran Revision Companion (github.com/Waqar144/quran_memorization_helper), MIT License. This app would not have a true 15-line muṣḥaf without his work; jazāhu Allāhu khayrā.",
  "creditDigitalKhattTitle": "DigitalKhatt",
  "creditDigitalKhattBody": "The DigitalKhatt project (github.com/DigitalKhatt, sponsored by Tarteel AI) built the parametric Arabic typesetting behind the 15-line muṣḥaf’s fonts — dynamic glyph justification that keeps every printed line and page break authentic.",
